OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy unlawfully killed in
OL,4,A1984, inquest concludes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA schoolboy who was last seen when he
OL,7,Fleft his home on his bike to fly a kite
OL,8,Fin September 1984 was unlawfully
OL,9,Fkilled, a coroner has concluded.
OL,11,FThe body of 15-year-old Mark Billington
OL,12,Fwas found two months later hanging in a
OL,13,Ftree in woodland on the edge of
OL,14,FMeriden, near Coventry, nearly seven
OL,15,Fmiles (11km) from his home in South
OL,16,FYardley, Birmingham.
OL,18,FPolice at the time treated the death as
OL,19,Fa suicide, but it became a murder
OL,20,Finquiry in 2002. No-one has ever been
OL,21,Fcharged.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
