OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy unlawfully killed in
OL,4,A1984, inquest concludes
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing senior coroner Louise Hunt's
OL,7,Fconclusion on Tuesday, Mark's family
OL,8,Fsaid: "We finally received some form of
OL,9,Fjustice after 42 years of heartache".
